  "notes": [
    "Same rig, bones, animations and hitbox as the Tidewraith; only textures and added boxes change.",
    "A deep-sea form: navy-black skin covered in glowing cyan spots, deep violet coral, and a glowing lure on a stalk over the head like an anglerfish.",
    "Two extra long tendrils hang from the belly (add bones tendril_5 and tendril_6, or parent them to tendril_2 and tendril_3).",
    "Spawns in Drowned Reach splinter rooms, and on Coral Drift islands at night; its adds are Reef Mites.",
    "Face (chosen design A 'Manta'): paint docs/shattered-skies/textures/tidewraith_abyssal_face.png (16x12, + _glowmask) on the head's front face. Slanted slit eyes at the outer corners, wide filter mouth with dark gill rakers (no teeth), pale chin, violet splinter crack on the brow."
